{"id":"e409b262805c593e","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-proper-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Proper Ideal","display":"df-zfc-proper-ideal — ZFC Proper Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-proper-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-proper-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-proper-ideal — ZFC Proper Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-proper-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-proper-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-proper-ideal — ZFC Proper Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b60087b035a4d082\" href=\"?note=b60087b035a4d082\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,A\\in V\">\\(J,A\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A)\\)</span>（集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的真理想，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b60087b035a4d082\" href=\"?note=b60087b035a4d082\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本文件补齐的兼容谓词，参数顺序为理想、底集合）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S(J,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S(J,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>补齐 cofinal-subproduct 已引用但缺失的文件；真理想不额外要求包含全部单点集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"b60087b035a4d082","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"b60087b035a4d082","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A)$（集合 $A$ 上的真理想，见 [[../batch04/58-df-ideal-set.md]]）。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}proper\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S(J,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperSetIdeal}_S(J,A).","display":true}],"bytes":809,"backlinks":[{"id":"f7706a8186f343cf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-proper-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-proper-ideal]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["b60087b035a4d082"]}